        "body": "Status: on `main`, `glab token rotate` only prints the new token to stdout and never updates the keyring or config file (`internal/commands/token/rotate/rotate.go`). The `--self` flag this issue builds on is in open MR !3915, and draft !4095 (stacked on it) adds the store-and-warn behavior with tests for keyring, config file, environment, no stored token, and a failed write. Until then, `glab token rotate --user @me <token-name> | glab auth login --stdin` re-stores the token (add `--hostname <host>` for a self-managed instance). Remaining work is medium: land !3915, then rebase and review !4095. Related: #7856.\n\n_This triage was AI-assisted and has not been validated by a maintainer. Treat the findings as a starting point._"
      },
