        "body": "Closing as a duplicate of #8204, which tracks removing the hidden global `-R` override from the root command, including why the 18.3 TODO no longer holds and the breaking-change impact. The TODO is still at [`internal/commands/root.go`](https://gitlab.com/gitlab-org/cli/-/blob/main/internal/commands/root.go#L157-160). !2947 implemented the removal and was closed for inactivity, so it can be reopened or picked up from there. Note that `internal/commands/mcp/serve/server_test.go` models the hidden root flag and needs updating with the removal.\n\nIf you think this should remain open or be revisited, please let us know."
      },
