        "body": "Today [`ListGitLabTemplates`](https://gitlab.com/gitlab-org/cli/-/blob/main/internal/cmdutils/cmdutils.go#L129-159) returns an empty list for any error. Missing: distinguishing \"not exist\" and \"not in a repository\" (stay quiet) from other errors (return them), plus test cases for each. Callers in `issue create` and `mr create` already surface returned errors, so this is a small change confined to one function and its test.\n\n_This triage was AI-assisted and has not been validated by a maintainer. Treat the findings as a starting point._"
      },
